.. raw:: html

    <div class="sphx-glr-thumbcontainer" tooltip="For two competing channels A \xrightarrow{k_1} B and A \xrightarrow{k_2} C, the reactant decays with the sum k_1 + k_2, while the product ratio [B]/[C] = k_1/k_2 is fixed at every instant -- the kinetic basis of product selectivity. Integrated with parallel.">

.. only:: html

  .. image:: /api/gallery/kinetics/networks/images/thumb/sphx_glr_plot_05_parallel_reactions_thumb.png
